From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [model] feat: model.gradient_checkpointing_retain_attention,
 attention outputs kept within a checkpoint

A checkpointed full-attention layer keeps its FlashAttention-4 or -3 outputs from its forward to its backward,
whose recompute replays them instead of running the attention again. Off by default.
